title: "Slate"
abstract: "A desktop prompt studio for AI filmmaking: plan shots scene by scene, keep characters, locations, and look consistent, direct coverage and music and voices with a local AI brain, and compile production-ready prompts for any image, video, music, or voice generator. This fork adds a Rust film-factory engine (MCP/Hermes + ComfyUI packs)."
